 Command line input:
 > /path/to/xtbopt.xyz -v2i -gfn2 --etemp 298.15 --chrg 0 --uhf 0 --noreftopo --opt tight -squick --T 8

  -v2i : iMTD-GC
  -gfn2 : Use of GFN2-xTB requested.
  --chrg 0
  --uhf 0
  --opt 1
  -squick  : very crude quick-mode (no NORMMD, no GC, crude opt.)
  --T 8 (CPUs/Threads selected)
 
